        "epId": 4570,
        "name": "静水流涌之辉",
        "desc": "<p>萦绕着至纯之水的权杖，在遥远的昔日曾象征着海原之上至高的权威。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/11/08/82021897/9807aa25f336daae391a6f6d4995af3d_7818631910285980102.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4334,
        "name": "船坞长剑",
        "desc": "<p>如今几乎绝迹的便利切割工具，能够随着使用将钝化的刀片换掉。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/30/82021897/eac5d6d4056f7b28c876e64866825e46_8789489177917235262.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3984,
        "name": "海渊终曲",
        "desc": "<p>如神秘海渊一般沉默的长剑，比它看似所属的年代还要更加古老。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/16/47826599/b71cc98eae057203ed634565ab2e3cc5_8987226868916807000.png",
        "amount": 1,
